HB0320 Taxation and Revenue Task Force 2028.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Storer, Clouston, Larsen, L and
Thayer and Senator(s) Driskill and Pappas
AN ACT relating to the administration of government; creating the Taxation and
Revenue Task Force 2028; assigning duties to the task force related to taxation
and revenue for local governments and education; specifying members, duties and
duration of the task force; providing appropriations; and providing for an
effective date.
